WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.609
Compare three fictional options for the same weekly planning need.

00:00:04.609 --> 00:00:10.600
Option one is an editable template with instructions, an example and a checklist.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:17.052
Option two is a short guide with worked examples and a blank planning page.

00:00:17.052 --> 00:00:22.583
The simpler alternative is a one-page checklist used with an existing notebook.

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:27.652
Compare the action, access, explanation, review effort and support each requires.

00:00:27.652 --> 00:00:33.183
Do not call any preference verified; there is no supplied audience test.

00:00:33.183 --> 00:00:41.479
Choose the template provisionally because it directly supports entering priorities and task owners within the stated provider capacity.

00:00:41.479 --> 00:00:45.166
Record why the guide and checklist were considered.

00:00:45.166 --> 00:00:47.470
Include only the supplied material.

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:50.235
Exclude custom reviews and ongoing coaching.

00:00:50.235 --> 00:00:54.844
The user supplies accurate permitted information and checks the plan.

00:00:54.844 --> 00:00:58.070
Keep provider responsibility for the promised deliverable.
